  "screen_name": "options_matrix",
  "bookmarks": 0,
  "favorites": 0,
  "created_at": "Thu Apr 09 08:36:29 +0000 2026",
  "text": "The abs delta filter is the right call. Short-dated ITM options carry massive intrinsic value that distorts pure volatility signals. Delta-normalized skew strips out that noise and shows you what the market is actually pricing in for marginal moves. Short-dated skew can flip based on maturity choice alone, which is why term structure matters as much as strike shape.",
